<title>UK: IATA accredit two Italian cargo agents.</title>
<headline>IATA accredit two Italian cargo agents.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Air Transport Association (IATA) has approved two Italian companies as accredited IATA cargo agents.</p>
<p>The firms are GMC International Trade Srl of Catania and Aviosped Cargo Service Srl of Segrate.</p>
<p>Accredited agents meet basic financial, professional and security criteria set by IATA. - Reuters Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax:5017</p>
</text>
